{
  "tema": 7077,
  "slug": "voz-pasiva-progresiva",
  "titulo": "Passive in progressive tenses: está siendo + participle",
  "subtitulo": "Está siendo atendido. Estaban siendo interrogados.",
  "foto": "t08.jpg",
  "regla": "The progressive passive is estar + siendo + participle: El paciente está siendo atendido = is being treated. Estar changes tense; siendo never changes; the participle agrees with the subject. Compound progressive: ha estado siendo investigado.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "estar (any tense)",
            "+ siendo",
            "+ participle (agrees)",
            "(+ por + agent)"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "_is / was being + participle_: the action is in progress."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Siendo** is invariable; the participle agrees: **las casas están siendo pintadas**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Active → passive: **La policía está interrogando a Miguel** → **Miguel está siendo interrogado por la policía**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Common in news; in speech, **lo están atendiendo** sounds more natural."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **siendo** = _being_, word for word."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Mi amigo ==está siendo atacado== ahora mismo.",
              "en": "My friend is being attacked right now."
            },
            {
              "es": "Los libros ==estaban siendo acomodados== en los estantes.",
              "en": "The books were being arranged on the shelves."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Estuve siendo atendida== durante horas por una vendedora muy amable.",
              "en": "I was being helped for hours by a very kind salesclerk."
            },
            {
              "es": "Miguel ==ha estado siendo interrogado== por la policía.",
              "en": "Miguel has been (being) questioned by the police."
            },
            {
              "es": "Ella ==había estado siendo acosada== por un exnovio.",
              "en": "She had been being harassed by an ex-boyfriend."
            },
            {
              "es": "El caso ==está siendo investigado==.",
              "en": "The case is being investigated."
            }
          ]
        }
